:: Mine Night Passout
<<effects>>

<<if $mine.hope gte 30>>
	<<generate1>>
	You wake up with your head lying on something soft. You open your eyes and are met with a <<person1>><<person>> staring down at you. You lift your head from <<his>> lap. <<He>> makes sure you're okay before you stand up.
<<else>>
	You wake up with your head lying on the hard rock. You open your eyes to see everybody ignoring you. Your head aches as you stand up. <<pain 5>> <<gpain>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Mining Passout
<<effects>><<generate1>>

<<if random(1,3) is 1>>
	You wake up to a wave of water hitting you. A <<person1>><<person>> stands over you. "No sleeping on the job," <<he>> says angrily. <<stress 20>><<gggstress>><<trauma 20>><<gggtrauma>>

	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Mining]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<mine_unshackle>>
	You wake up to a <<person1>><<person>> dragging you across the hard rock. <span class="blue">Your shackles are gone.</span> You try to struggle from <<his>> grasp. <<He>> lets you go and drops on top of you.

	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Mining Passout Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>



